title: Teddy
---
<<declare $speak_to_teddy = false>>
<<if $checked_box == false>>
	...
	Dad must be tired.
	Let's let him sleep for a little while longer
<<else>>
	<<if $speak_to_teddy == false>>
		//Speak with Teddy
		<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
		Ashe: Dad. Wake up. We need to talk.
		<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe" "Teddy">>
		Teddy: A-ashe? Y-yawn. What did you want to talk about?
		<<show_character_expression CharacterManager "Ashe" "angry">>
		Ashe: Why didn't you tell me about the eviction! 
		<<show_character_expression CharacterManager "Teddy" "sad">>
		Teddy:...
		<<set $speak_to_teddy = true>>
		<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
		Ashe: I need to speak to Janet. Maybe she's being evicted too
	<<else>>
		<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe" "Teddy">>
		Ashe:...
		Teddy: I'm sorry Ashe.
		<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
	<<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Neighbour
---
<<if $speak_to_teddy == true>>
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe" "Neighbour">>
	Ashe: Janet! Do you know anything about the eviction?
	Janet: ...So you've seen it too.
	Janet: Don't get involved Ashe. This is too dangerous for someone as young as you.
	Janet: Even your father ...
	<<show_character_expression CharacterManager "Ashe" "angry">>
	Ashe: "What about my dad?"
	Janet: ...
	Janet: It's Victor Winslow. He owns this complex.
	Janet: ... I know I won't be able to stop you. Stay safe Ashe.
	Ashe: ...
	<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
	Ashe: ... What do I have to lose? 
	<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
	<<change_location GameManager "Location1">>
<<endif>>
===

